                          "tag": "td",
                          "attrs": {
                            "colspan": "2"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            "One transaction receives a deadlock error; the victim is not predetermined. ROLLBACK in both sessions. Repeat using row order 1 then 2 in both sessions: one waits, but this cycle cannot form. Commit the first before finishing the second."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
